  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at empowering youth in sustainable vocational skills so that they are employable or can start their own initiatives to earn income in a dignified way hence creating economic empowerment.
The project will develop the use of sustainable vocational skills in their organisations in order to support youth empowerment and financial development. The target group is out of school youth in rural areas. This work will be done through promoting community based vocational training, a less formal skills training system than what is offered in more urban areas.India, Tanzania and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
